config FEC_MTIP_L2SW
	tristate "MoreThanIP L2 switch support to FEC driver"
	depends on OF
	depends on NET_SWITCHDEV
	depends on BRIDGE
	depends on SOC_IMX28 || COMPILE_TEST
	help
	  This enables support for the MoreThanIP L2 switch on i.MX
	  SoCs (e.g. i.MX287). It offloads bridging to this IP block's
	  hardware and allows switch management with standard Linux tools.
	  This switch driver can be used interchangeably with the already
	  available FEC driver, depending on the use case's requirements.
